# svc/signal/app/kuksa-can-provider — Eclipse Kuksa's CAN provider, relabeled under vxedge's own
# registry namespace (the thin-relabel pattern of svc/signal/app/kuksa-databroker: no source build).
#
# Upstream image 0.5.1 (read from the image config with oras, 2026-11-13): entrypoint ./dbcfeeder,
# working directory /dist, no exposed port (it is a client of the databroker). The image carries a
# default config (config/dbc_feeder.ini), VSS mappings (mapping/), a sample DBC and a sample CAN
# trace (candump.log), so it replays CAN traffic with no CAN interface. See this part's README.
#
# Run:    podman run --rm -e KUKSA_ADDRESS=grpc://<databroker>:55555 <ref>

ARG UPSTREAM
FROM ${UPSTREAM}
